already `max` characters or fewer, it is returned unchanged.\n- **Long text:** it is cut to `max - 1` characters and \"…\" is appended, so the result is exactly `max` characters.\n- **Edge cases I chose:** `max` of 0 or less returns an empty string, and `max` of 1 returns just \"…\".\n\nBeyond the function itself, I made two additions you didn't ask for:\n- A `truncate` case in `test/index.test.js`.\n- An \"Added\" entry under `[Unreleased]` in `CHANGELOG.md`, since the project keeps one.\n\nNothing is committed. \"Length\" means UTF-16 code units, so an emoji or other character outside the Basic Multilingual Plane counts as 2 and could be split at the cut. Tell me if you want grapheme-aware truncation.","ttft_ms":1673,"type":"result","duration_ms":11559,"uuid":"bd3e3531-ecad-4525-b886-ece1adf9af9d","ttft_stream_ms":1259,"time_to_request_ms":519,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":8,"system_prompt":376,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":15,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":0,"tool_pool_refresh":2,"init_message":8,"init_frame_send":3,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":2,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":5,"query_setup":2,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":56,"message_normalization":21,"client_creation":2,"request_build":8},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":35,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":189,"time_to_request_major_faults":1,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":208,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":128,"process_rss_mib_result":234,"process_anon_mib_result":141,"process_peak_rss_mib":237,"process_cpu_ms_turn":955,"process_wall_ms_turn":11559,"tool_pool_build_count":3,"tool_pool_build_lapsed_count":0,"tool_pool_moved_at_lapse_count":0,"tool_pool_limit_ms":30000,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":384,"process_wall_ms_streaming":7409,"main_stream_count":4,"main_stream_event_count":258,"main_stream_chunk_count":211,"process_turn_states":{"main_stream":{"cpu_ms":384,"wall_ms":